      "writtenOn": "2018-03-22T11:25:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Naive crypto question:\n looks strange to me to use CBC mode but re-initialize it on every iteration of the loop ?\nis it correct ?\nif so, maybe there is a clever optimization then (eg use ECB mode)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 119,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 120,
        "endChar": 2
      },
      "revId": "599bfa777053ed93db64d27930f0fd4b49d819d1",
