      "author": {
        "id": 1000016
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-04-03T09:29:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CBC really meant propagating some init from the previous block,\nif we don\u0027t (to get a correct answer), we should go for something simpler which doesn\u0027t require the init everytime.\nI have seen other implementations using ECB mode.",
      "parentUuid": "a74c9bb3_37ebd100",
